# Anime Airing Board — Handoff Document

## 1. Project Overview

A single-file HTML app (`index.html`) that tracks currently-airing anime:
- Pulls the user's AniList "currently watching" list via GraphQL
- Matches shows against SubsPlease RSS feeds to learn real release times
- Displays shows on a weekly board with an "Up Next" countdown panel
- Persists state in IndexedDB (slot cache, overrides, added shows, final holdovers) + localStorage (offset, page settings)

**Key constants:**
- Timezone: `Europe/Berlin` (auto-detected via `Intl`)
- RSS feeds: `https://subsplease.org/rss/?r=1080` and `?r=720`
- Refresh: every 5 min; countdown tick every 30s

